  "content": {
    "title": "Who is in Final Four? March Madness NCAA Tournament team breakdown",
    "text": "Updated March 29, 2026, 5:45 p.m. MTWho is in the Final Four?We are down to four teams remaining in the 2026 NCAA Tournament after the Elite 8 games on Sunday, March 30.Who are the teams that are just two wins away from the national championship?Take a quick look at the four teams remaining in March Madness, who have their sights set on a national title.The Big Ten has teams in March Madness entering the Final Four, while the Big 12 and Big East each have one.How to watch Final Four: Illinois vs UConn | Michigan vs Arizona | Schedule | Who is in Final Four? | Final Four ticketsWatch Final Four games on Sling UConn HuskiesThe Huskies overcame a 44-29 halftime deficit to knock off Duke, the No. 1 seed in the East Region, in the Elite Eight, 73-72.UConn is the No. 2 seed in the East. It will face Illinois in the Final Four.Tarris Reed Jr. led UConn with 26 points and nine rebounds.Final Four picks: Illinois vs UConn | Michigan vs Arizona | The Republic's predictions Michigan WolverinesMichigan jumped out to a 48-26 lead at halftime and never looked back on its way to a 95-62 win over Tennessee in the Elite 8.The Wolverines, the No. 1 seed in the Midwest, will face Arizona in the Final Four.Michigan shot 52% from the field and 37% from 3 in the win, while suffocating the Volunteers on defense. Yaxel Lendeborg led Michigan with 27 points.Final Four odds: UConn vs Illinois | Arizona vs Michigan | Betting odds | National championship odds Arizona WildcatsLed by a group of freshmen, the Wildcats are back in the Final Four for the first time in 25 years.Arizona, the No. 1 seed in the West, trailed Purdue at the half, but rallied for a 79-64 victory.Koa Peat led Arizona with 20 points. Illinois Fighting IlliniIllinois was the first to punch its ticket to the Final Four with a 71-59 victory over Iowa in the South Region championship game.Illinois (28-8), the third seed in the region, had little trouble with Iowa (24-13).Keaton Wagler led the Illini with 25 points.When is the Final Four?The Final Four games will be played on Saturday, April 4, 2026.Reach Jeremy Cluff at jeremy.cluff@arizonarepublic.com. Follow him on X, formerly Twitter @Jeremy_Cluff.Support local journalism: Subscribe to azcentral.com today. Sign up for azcentral Preps Now. And be sure to subscribe to our daily sports newsletters so you don't miss a thing.",
